  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Prerequisite: Must have 24 Frames Rule</em></p>\n<p>As an action for 4 cursed energy, you create a 5 ft wide, 30 foot long line of frames in the air that you explosively break. All creatures in that line must make a Dexterity saving throw or take a number d10s in force damage equal to your CE modifier and are knocked prone. On a failed save, they take half as much damage.</p>",
